#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "សេចក្តីណែនាំ​ "

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krdc; lets you view and control a desktop on another computer. You can use "
"it to work on a remote machine or help another user. The computer you "
"connect to must run a compatible remote desktop server; &krdc; is the client "
"and does not enable desktop sharing on that computer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krdc; supports <acronym>VNC</acronym> (Virtual Network Computing), "
"<acronym>RDP</acronym> (Remote Desktop Protocol), and <acronym>SPICE</"
"acronym>. The protocols available in your installation depend on the "
"installed and enabled plugins. For example, you can connect to a desktop "
"shared by &krfb; using <acronym>VNC</acronym>, to a Remote Desktop server "
"using <acronym>RDP</acronym>, or to a virtual machine with a <acronym>SPICE</"
"acronym> server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start &krdc; from your application launcher or run <userinput><command>krdc</"
"command></userinput> in a terminal. For command-line examples, see <xref "
"linkend=\"command-line\"/>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Supported Protocols"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krdc; supports <acronym>VNC</acronym>, <acronym>RDP</acronym>, and "
"<acronym>SPICE</acronym> through protocol plugins. Select the protocol that "
"matches the server on the remote computer. The client and server can run "
"different operating systems."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>VNC</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>VNC</acronym> uses the Remote Frame Buffer (<acronym>RFB</acronym>) "
"protocol. The server sends updates of its desktop image to the client, and "
"the client sends keyboard and pointer input back to the server. It is "
"commonly used to share an existing desktop session."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"https://apps.kde.org/krfb/\">&krfb;</ulink> is &kde;'s desktop "
"sharing application and provides a <acronym>VNC</acronym> server for sharing "
"a &plasma; desktop. Start and configure &krfb; on the computer whose desktop "
"you want to share, then connect to it from &krdc; using <acronym>VNC</"
"acronym>. Other compatible VNC servers can also be used."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Connection speed and the amount of change on the remote screen affect "
"responsiveness. If updates are slow, try a lower <acronym>VNC</acronym> "
"quality setting in <xref linkend=\"vnc-settings\"/>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>RDP</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>RDP</acronym> (Remote Desktop Protocol) provides remote access to a "
"desktop, with features such as audio playback and clipboard exchange. "
"Available features depend on the server and its configuration."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kde; &plasma;, <ulink url=\"https://invent.kde.org/plasma/krdp\"> "
"<application>KRDP</application></ulink> provides an RDP server for sharing a "
"Wayland desktop session. Configure remote desktop access in &plasma;'s "
"&systemsettings;, then connect from &krdc; using <acronym>RDP</acronym>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>RDP</acronym> is also used natively by &Microsoft; &Windows; Remote "
"Desktop. You can connect to a Windows PC after enabling Remote Desktop on "
"it. Hosting incoming connections requires a supported edition; Windows Home "
"does not include the Remote Desktop server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For display, sound, sharing, gateway, and other connection options, see "
"<xref linkend=\"rdp-settings\"/>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>SPICE</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<acronym>SPICE</acronym> is commonly used to access the graphical console of "
"a virtual machine. <application>QEMU</application> can provide a SPICE "
"server for a guest, and tools such as <application>virt-manager</"
"application> can configure that server through <application>libvirt</"
"application>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable a SPICE display for the virtual machine and obtain its listening "
"address and port from the virtualization configuration. In &krdc;, connect "
"to the host running QEMU and the port assigned to that virtual machine. This "
"connects to the guest's console through the virtualization host, rather than "
"to a remote desktop server running inside the guest."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The guest agent, <application>spice-vdagent</application>, enables "
"integration features such as clipboard sharing and dynamic resolution "
"changes. See <xref linkend=\"spice-settings\"/> for &krdc; options and the "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.spice-space.org/spice-user-manual.html\">SPICE User "
"Manual</ulink> for QEMU, virt-manager, and guest configuration."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &krdc;"
msgstr "ការប្រើប្រាស់​ការតភ្ជាប់​ផ្ទៃតុពីចម្ងាយ "

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &krdc;"
msgstr "ទីនេះ​ជា​រូបថត​អេក្រង់​របស់ការតភ្ជាប់​ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ "

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "&krdc; main window"
msgstr "បង្អួចមេរ​បស់ការតភ្ជាប់ពីចម្ងាយ​ "

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connecting &krdc; to compatible servers"
msgstr "កំពុង​តភ្ជាប់​ការតភ្ជាប់​ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ​ទៅ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើឆបគ្នា "

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before connecting, enable the appropriate remote desktop server on the "
"remote computer and obtain its address and login details. The server must be "
"reachable from your computer, and its firewall must allow the required "
"connection."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>New Connection</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> to open the connection page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>vnc</guilabel>, <guilabel>rdp</guilabel>, or "
"<guilabel>spice</guilabel> in the protocol selector next to "
"<guilabel>Connect to:</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the server address in the form <userinput>[username@]host[:port]</"
"userinput>, then press <keycap>Enter</keycap> or click the arrow button next "
"to the address. The protocol is already selected, so do not prepend it to "
"this field."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Review the host settings if prompted, and enter the credentials required by "
"the server. Each connection opens in a tab."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: acronym
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "<acronym>VNC</acronym>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter <userinput>megan</userinput> for the default port 5900. For display 1 "
"on port 5901, enter <userinput>megan:1</userinput> or <userinput>megan:5901</"
"userinput>. Port numbers below 100 are interpreted as <acronym>VNC</acronym> "
"display numbers and added to 5900."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Entering a hostname into &krdc;</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>កំពុង​បញ្ចូល​ឈ្មោះម៉ាស៊ីន​នៅក្នុង​ការតភ្ជាប់ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Entering a hostname into &krdc;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>កំពុង​បញ្ចូល​ឈ្មោះម៉ាស៊ីន​នៅក្នុង​ការតភ្ជាប់ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ</phrase>"

#. Tag: acronym
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "<acronym>RDP</acronym>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter <userinput>megan</userinput> for the default port 3389, or "
"<userinput>megan:3390</userinput> for a different port. You can include a "
"user name, for example <userinput>alice@megan</userinput>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: acronym
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "<acronym>SPICE</acronym>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the host and port of the virtual machine's <acronym>SPICE</acronym> "
"server, for example <userinput>vmhost:5902</userinput>. The default port is "
"5900."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The connection page also lists bookmarks, connection history, and "
"<acronym>VNC</acronym> services advertised on the local network through "
"Zeroconf. Typing in the address field filters this list. You can select a "
"listed connection and use <guimenuitem>Connect</guimenuitem> from its "
"context menu. The <guilabel>Remote Desktops</guilabel> panel provides "
"another way to find saved and discovered connections."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "What happens when you connect"
msgstr "តើមានអ្វីកើតឡើង​ពេលអ្នក​តភ្ជាប់ "

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Host Configuration</guilabel> dialog contains settings for the "
"selected protocol. Clear <guilabel>Show this dialog again for this host</"
"guilabel> to reuse them without being prompted on each connection. Settings "
"are associated with the connection address; connecting by a different host "
"name or IP address can use a different configuration."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&krdc; connection speed selection</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>ការជ្រើស​ល្បឿន​ការតភ្ជាប់​ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ​</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&krdc; connection speed selection</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>ការជ្រើស​ល្បឿន​ការតភ្ជាប់​ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ​</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the server requests authentication, enter your password and, if "
"requested, your user name. The <guilabel>Remember password</guilabel> option "
"allows &krdc; to store credentials through the system credential store using "
"QtKeychain. Password storage also depends on the global <guilabel>Remember "
"passwords</guilabel> setting."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&krdc; password entry</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>ធាតុ​ពាក្យសម្ងាត់របស់ការតភ្ជាប់ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ​</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&krdc; password entry</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>ធាតុ​ពាក្យសម្ងាត់របស់ការតភ្ជាប់ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ​</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For <acronym>RDP</acronym>, &krdc; may ask you to verify an unknown or "
"changed server certificate. Check the certificate details with the server "
"administrator before accepting it. The dialog offers <guilabel>Remember this "
"certificate</guilabel> for subsequent connections."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The tab icon indicates connection status. After authentication succeeds, you "
"can view or control the remote desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "Controlling the remote desktop connection"
msgstr "ការត្រួតពិនិត្យ​​ការតភ្ជាប់​ផ្ទៃតុពីចម្ងាយ "

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the keyboard and mouse in a connected tab to work on the remote desktop. "
"The toolbar shown below provides controls for opening connections, changing "
"the view, and interacting with the remote desktop. Buttons may be "
"unavailable depending on the protocol and connection state."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:308
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "<screeninfo>&krdc; window</screeninfo>"
