#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When <guilabel>Remember connection history</guilabel> is enabled, successful "
"connections are recorded under <menuchoice><guimenu>Bookmarks</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>History</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and appear in the "
"connection list. Right-click a saved entry in the list to connect, rename "
"it, change its settings, or delete it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a bookmarked connection, the settings dialog can also edit its "
"<guilabel>Name:</guilabel> and <guilabel>URL:</guilabel>. Use a complete URL "
"such as <userinput>rdp://alice@megan:3389</userinput>, keeping the same "
"protocol. Changes to connection settings may take effect only when you "
"reconnect."
msgstr ""

