msgstr "ចំណូលចិត្ត​ការតភ្ជាប់ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ​- ផ្ទាំង<guilabel>RDP លំនាំដើម​</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:615
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Gateway</guilabel> tab configures access through an RDP "
"gateway, which provides a route to a remote desktop on another network. "
"Enter the gateway address in <guilabel>Server:</guilabel> as <userinput>host:"
"port</userinput>, using the port supplied by your administrator. Keep the "
"destination computer's address on the main connection page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:621
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the gateway account's <guilabel>Domain:</guilabel>, <guilabel>Username:"
"</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Password:</guilabel> as required. These fields "
"authenticate access to the gateway; the remote desktop may require separate "
"credentials."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Transport type:</guilabel> offers <guilabel>Auto</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>HTTP</guilabel>, and <guilabel>RPC</guilabel>. Use <guilabel>Auto</"
"guilabel> unless your administrator specifies a transport. Leave the gateway "
"<guilabel>Server:</guilabel> field empty when connecting without an RDP "
"gateway."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If SSH tunnel support is available, an additional <guilabel>SSH tunnel</"
"guilabel> tab appears in the host configuration dialog. See <xref linkend="
"\"ssh-tunnels\"/> for its options."
msgstr ""

