msgstr "ចំណូលចិត្ត​ការតភ្ជាប់ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ​- ផ្ទាំង<guilabel>VNC lលំនាំដើម​</guilabel>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:671
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>VNC Defaults</guilabel> tab"
msgid "<phrase>&krdc; preferences - <guilabel>SSH</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "ចំណូលចិត្ត​ការតភ្ជាប់ផ្ទៃតុ​ពីចម្ងាយ​- ផ្ទាំង<guilabel>VNC lលំនាំដើម​</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:677
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your installation includes SSH tunnel support, the host settings offer "
"<guilabel>Connect via SSH tunnel</guilabel>. Enter the SSH port and user "
"name for the same host as the remote desktop server. SSH authentication is "
"separate from remote desktop authentication."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:682
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Tunnel via loopback address</guilabel> makes the tunnel connect to "
"the remote desktop service through the remote host's loopback address. Use "
"this when the service listens only on that address. The remote desktop port "
"still comes from the connection address."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:690
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting connections from the command line"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:691
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pass a complete URL to connect directly:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:692
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>krdc</command> rdp://alice@megan</userinput>\n"
"<userinput><command>krdc</command> vnc://megan:5901</userinput>\n"
"<userinput><command>krdc</command> spice://vmhost:5902</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:694
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <option>--fullscreen</option> with one URL to start that connection in "
"full screen. You can also pass several URLs to open multiple connections:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:696
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>krdc</command> --fullscreen rdp://megan</userinput>\n"
"<userinput><command>krdc</command> vnc://megan rdp://workstation</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:698
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In a complete URL, percent-encode reserved characters in the user name. For "
"example, use <userinput>rdp://alice%40example.org@megan</userinput> for the "
"user name <literal>alice@example.org</literal>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:702
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krdc; can read basic connection details from an <filename>.rdp</filename> "
"file passed on the command line:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:704
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput><command>krdc</command> connection.rdp</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This reads the server address, user name, domain, and a password field if "
"present; it does not import every setting supported by other RDP clients. "
"Use the host configuration dialog for other options. Run "
"<userinput><command>krdc</command> <option>--help</option></userinput> for "
"command-line help."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:714
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "សំណួរ​ និង​ចម្លើយ​ "

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:717
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why is a protocol missing or an address rejected?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:718
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check that the corresponding plugin is installed and enabled in "
"<guilabel>Plugins</guilabel>, then restart &krdc;. Check the selected "
"protocol and address syntax in <xref linkend=\"compatible-versions\"/>. RDP "
"support uses the FreeRDP libraries directly; it does not require launching "
"an external <command>xfreerdp</command> executable."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:725
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why can I not connect to the remote computer?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:726
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check the host name, port, network or VPN connection, and whether the remote "
"desktop server is running. Ensure its firewall permits the connection. For "
"authentication failures, check your user name, password, domain, and "
"permission to log in remotely. If you use a proxy, gateway, or SSH tunnel, "
"check its settings and credentials too."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:733
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why can I see the desktop but not control it?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:734
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turn off <guimenuitem>View Only</guimenuitem> in the <guimenu>Session</"
"guimenu> menu. The server may also restrict your connection to viewing; ask "
"the person administering the remote desktop to check its permissions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:740
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why does copying and pasting not work?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:741
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable <guimenuitem>Clipboard Sharing</guimenuitem>, disable "
"<guimenuitem>View Only</guimenuitem>, and check that the server supports the "
"content you are copying. For VNC, the password-manager filter can "
"deliberately block copied passwords. For SPICE, check the guest agent."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:747
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I change settings after hiding the host dialog?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:748
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open <guilabel>Hosts</guilabel> in the application preferences, select the "
"host, and click <guibutton>Configure...</guibutton>. You can enable "
"<guilabel>Show this dialog again for this host</guilabel> there."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I report a problem?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:754
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Report bugs at <ulink url=\"https://bugs.kde.org\">the &kde; bug tracker</"
"ulink>. Include your &krdc; version, protocol, local operating system, "
"server software, and steps to reproduce the problem. Omit passwords and "
"other private connection details."
msgstr ""

